         "text": "Reversing the limits, \\( g(x) = -\\int_{3}^{\\sin{\\left(x \\right)}} 4 t^{2} \\, dt \\), so by the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus its derivative is minus the integrand evaluated at \\( \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} \\).",
